# Orfen (29014), a level 1 grand boss standing 500 from a level 10 character, more than 8 levels
# above it: a hit of 10 makes it want its curse (4515) on the character at 1000000 beside the
# attack desire of the damage, 10 / 1000 / 0.05 * 10000. On draws of 99 it neither pulls the
# character nor wants its area paralysis.
# Its curse's landing roll is pinned to 0 (roll line): the landing rate is at most 99 of 100, so an
# unpinned roll would leave the character unaffected one run in a hundred.
character Hunter 10
random always 99
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.boss.orfen.Orfen
npc orfen 29014 GrandBoss 500 0 0 skill DEBUFF 4515 1 skill HOLD_MAGIC 4063 1 skill DD_MAGIC 4064 1
roll orfen 0

hit orfen 10
  S MagicSkillUse caster=orfen target=player skill=4515-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S SystemMessage id=110 4:4515,1
  desires orfen attack(player)=1999 cast(player,4515,move)=1000000
